From 5aa9bf3196269e83e03ab43a80f373046051a407 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harshkamdar67 <harshkamdar67@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 00:02:29 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 13/32] ggml, vulkan: fused Inkling 2 depth attention for
 batches

GGML_OP_INKLING_MIX normalizes up to nine states, scores them against up to four queries,
and writes the softmax-weighted sum, one workgroup per token. Used for batches; one token
keeps the separate ops, which spread wider. B60: pp512 1049 -> 1211, pp2048 1030 -> 1189,
two-token steps 57.6 -> 60.1 tok/s.
